# Tor client for the provider's Nostr relay connections. It offers only an
# HTTP CONNECT tunnel (the provider's relay_proxy) to the private Compose
# network, never a SOCKS port, and keeps its state on a tmpfs.
SocksPort 0
HTTPTunnelPort 0.0.0.0:9080
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:9051
CookieAuthentication 1
DataDirectory /var/lib/rill-tor
AvoidDiskWrites 1
Log notice stdout
